# Day 2 — Active Directory Client Integration, Group Policy & DNS Troubleshooting
## Objective
The objective of Day 2 was to expand the existing Active Directory environment by deploying a Windows 11 Pro client, joining it to the domain, implementing organizational structures and security groups, deploying a workstation Group Policy Object (GPO), and performing a controlled DNS troubleshooting exercise.

## Environment
| System              | Hostname | Role                       |
| ------------------- | -------- | -------------------------- |
| Proxmox             | MS01     | Virtualization host        |
| Windows Server 2022 | WS01     | Domain Controller and DNS  |
| Windows 11 Pro      | AC02     | Domain-joined workstation  |
| Windows 10 Home     | AC01     | Physical test client       |
| Linux Mint          | OPS01    | Administration workstation |

